    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Arm game involves one person with a box trying to reach the destination.</h2><br>Become the person who moves towards the goal while wearing the box.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Without arms, maintaining balance is very difficult (walking might be challenging as well).<br></li><li>It is possible to walk even with one leg missing.<br></li><li>Fortunately, there are checkpoints!<br></li><li>The maps are highly diverse.<br></li><li>Various obstacles like cannons, ice, and dolls will obstruct your journey.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185600/extras/cbddbf63fcb07fd689028a9fc0747876.poster.avif?t=1726277036\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185600/extras/cbddbf63fcb07fd689028a9fc0747876.webm?t=1726277036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185600/extras/cbddbf63fcb07fd689028a9fc0747876.mp4?t=1726277036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Arm game involves one person with a box trying to reach the destination.</h2><br>Become the person who moves towards the goal while wearing the box.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Without arms, maintaining balance is very difficult (walking might be challenging as well).<br></li><li>It is possible to walk even with one leg missing.<br></li><li>Fortunately, there are checkpoints!<br></li><li>The maps are highly diverse.<br></li><li>Various obstacles like cannons, ice, and dolls will obstruct your journey.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185600/extras/cbddbf63fcb07fd689028a9fc0747876.poster.avif?t=1726277036\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185600/extras/cbddbf63fcb07fd689028a9fc0747876.webm?t=1726277036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185600/extras/cbddbf63fcb07fd689028a9fc0747876.mp4?t=1726277036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
